SET S TO SHIP.
S:PARTS[0]:GETMODULE("HardDrive"):DOEVENT("transfer data here").
SET S:PARTS[0]:RESOURCES[0]:ENABLED TO TRUE.
RCS ON.
STAGE.
WAIT 5.
LOCK STEERING TO S:PROGRADE.
WAIT 90.
STAGE.
WAIT 15.
LOCK STEERING TO S:SRFRETROGRADE.
WAIT UNTIL S:ALTITUDE < 100000.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
WAIT UNTIL S:ALTITUDE < 90000.
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL S:ALTITUDE < 20000.
STAGE.